{"overview":"با تولد دوباره در بازی بیشوجوی مورد علاقه‌اش، کوسوکه نقش بدترین نقش ممکن را دریافت می‌کند: دستیار فراموش‌نشدنی. اما با دانش خود از بازی و بزرگ‌ترین منبع مانای این جهان، شاید حتی از قهرمان پیشی بگیرد! اکنون کوسوکه باید سرنوشت خود را بازنویسی کند و برای رسیدن به پایان خوش قهرمانان، به مبارزه بپردازد!","tagline":"","overview_en":"Reborn in his favorite bishojo game, Kousuke gets the worst role possible: the forgettable sidekick. But armed with his knowledge of the game and this world’s largest mana pool, he might even surpass the hero! Now Kousuke must rewrite his fate and battle his way toward the heroines’ happy endings!","tagline_en":"","runtime":24,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":13,"y":2026,"poster":"/7V70UHOfMRef1vlsNX396MJQMmT.jpg"}],"episodes":13,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"島﨑信長","role":"Takioto, Kousuke","photo":"/qke5rZusHsjSlvB0NKlJ5dQF5D.jpg","en":"Nobunaga Shimazaki"},{"name":"大西沙織","role":"Mizumori, Yukine","photo":"/cziKB19QMFJ6DQDtxTn07uRY2hq.jpg","en":"Saori Onishi"},{"name":"加隈亜衣","role":"Ludi","photo":"/o3tQSeeJAeafJNvQs2IKvpKY7av.jpg","en":"Ai Kakuma"},{"name":"مائو ایچیمیچی","role":"Nanami","photo":"/a3cflYtrlFK0LXfWODgLDO7E7CP.jpg","en":"Mao Ichimichi"},{"name":"遠野ひかる","role":"Katou, Rina","photo":"/mQ3BgehaQKedMbMkpnlz790U4fi.jpg","en":"Hikaru Tono"}],"trailer":"XqrBfyUNYZs","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/335194/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC5Y8bmGytV.png"},{"n":"Crunchyroll Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/qHLLmKo7udRgiSnIASVTwP2IxfJ.png"}]},"GB":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/335194/watch?locale=GB","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC5Y8bmGytV.png"},{"n":"Crunchyroll Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/qHLLmKo7udRgiSnIASVTwP2IxfJ.png"}]},"CA":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/335194/watch?locale=CA","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll Amazon